# No new dependencies without approval

## Context

This starter repo is small and self-contained. Adding new npm packages can
mask design issues and complicate grading.

## Rule

- Do not add new dependencies to `package.json` or `app/package.json` unless
  explicitly approved.
- Prefer implementing small utilities in `app/src/lib/` instead of pulling a
  dependency.

## How to verify

1. Check `git diff -- package.json` and `git diff -- app/package.json` for new
   entries.
2. Run `npm install` only if a dependency change is approved.